            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[A minor update, and the first one delivered by automatic update.

### Added

- **Default Discovery questions:** Fieldbook now comes with a list of discovery questions (253 in 30 categories), so customer meetings get a Discovery section from the start, without importing anything.

### Changed

- **Settings › AI › Discovery Questions › Import CSV…** asks whether to **add** the file's questions to the ones you have (questions already there are skipped) or **replace** them. **Use Default Questions…** goes back to the built-in list (it replaces **Remove…**).
- The version is 1.8.1 (build 13).
]]></description>
